olved, stop blocking the street! Crowds are just asking for trouble! Head home and wait for the news, everyone. Stay safe!",0,""],["bgm",""],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,true,true,0.75],["w",0.75],["bg","city_alley_dusk",0,0.0],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["cbg",0,-50.0,0.0,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.75],["w",1.25],["se","se_062"],["show","avg1_150","a","014",null,null,0.97,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_150","a",null,null,null,null,1.0,1.0,null,"OutQuad",0.5],["w",1.0],["bgm","m53"],["ctl","avg1_150","a","015","sigh",null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_150","Alright,==W== that's that...",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_150","a","028",null,null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["cbg",0,0.0,null,null,"OutQuad",0.65,null,null,null],["show","avg3_102","a","015",0.8,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_102","a",null,null,0.7,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuad",0.65],["ctl","avg1_150","a","018","question",0.3,null,null,null,null,"OutQuad",0.65],["say","avg1_150","Now what? Dinner and a breather, right?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_102","a","021",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_102","Are you kidding? We have people heading to the Association to give statements. We'll eat after.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_150","a","011","flurry",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.5],["tsk","Xiao"],["say","avg1_150","Seriously? It's almost dark and you're still at it! Can't they come back tomorrow?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_102","a","019",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_102","Tomorrow brings its own work. I can't turn away people who have come all this way with leads.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_150","a","029","awkward",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_150","I don't get it.==W== You work like this every day. Doesn't it wear you out?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_150","a","015",null,null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_102","a","018",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_102","Hmm...==W== Not really? Doesn't feel like I'm pushing myself.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_102","a","002","happy",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_102","a","015",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_102","Besides, I like keeping myself busy. Don't worry about me.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_150","a","009",null,null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_150","Hold on...==W== Keeping busy is one thing, but your schedule is nothing but work.",0,""],["w",0.5],["bg","mood_4",0,0.75],["ctl","avg1_150","a","010","awkward",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["tsk","Xiao"],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_150","a","008","exclamation",null,null,null,null,"daintou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_150","I'd never survive! Work is all about balance. Knowing when to slack off is crucial!",0,""],["w",0.5],["bg","city_alley_dusk",0,0.5],["cbg",0,null,null,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg3_102","a","003",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_102","Fair point. But I care about the Trekkers.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_150","a","021",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["ctl","avg3_102","a","015",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_102","The Trekker Association is their home. Everything we do protects their rights and keeps them safe.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_102","a","017",null,null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_102","So for me,==W== the fulfillment I get from work is its own reward.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_102","a","022","star",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_150","a","022","speechless",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_150","Hmm...==W== I suppose...",0,""],["w",0.7],["ctl","avg1_150","a","026",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Lin